@HostAddress = http://localhost:5225
@Version = v1

### Products: list
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/products
Accept: application/json

### Products: list with paging (limit and offset must be given together)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/products?limit=10&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### Products: one by id (the sandbox is resettable, so ids shift; take one from the list above)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Products: an id the upstream does not know -> 404
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/products/999999
Accept: application/json

### Products: create
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sample product",
  "price": 12,
  "description": "Created from the .http file",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "images": ["https://placehold.co/600x400"]
}

### Products: create with invalid input -> validation failure
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "price": 0,
  "description": "",
  "categoryId": 0,
  "images": []
}


### Categories: list
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/categories
Accept: application/json

### Categories: one by id
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/categories/1
Accept: application/json

### Categories: an id the upstream does not know -> 404
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/categories/999999
Accept: application/json

### Categories: create
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample category",
  "image": "https://placehold.co/600x400"
}

### Categories: create with invalid input -> validation failure
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "image": "not-a-url"
}

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Health: liveness (the process answers)
GET {{HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Health: readiness (the process answers and the upstream is reachable; Degraded still answers 200)
GET {{HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json
